  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOPS Ukraine Winterization Response (procurement contract)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to alleviate the pressure on the war affected population in Ukraine, in the areas where energy and heating infrastructure has been damaged the most, by stabilising and thus ensuring the uninterrupted electricity and heat supply. The project will assist Mykolaiv city and Oblast in maintaining uninterrupted electricity, water and heat supply as well as further restoration and functioning of activities. Morover, other affected areas across Ukraine will be supported, in coordination with the government, to restore infrastructure, secure energy supply and meet urgent winter needs.</narrative>
  </description>
